          { stage: "Stage 3 (Hybrid Turbo)", power: "190 - 210 hp", notes: "Requires a hybrid turbocharger and custom tuning. While physically possible, pushing past 180hp on the B38 is generally not recommended, as the cost vastly outweighs the benefits compared to simply purchasing a 4-cylinder 220i.", zeroToHundred: "7.1s", hundredToTwoHundred: "N/A" }
